  <h1>Hardware</h1>

<h2 id=3D"launch-a-dell-x86-hpc-cluster">Launch: A Dell x86 HPC Cluster</h2=
>
<div class=3D"md-typeset__scrollwrap"><div class=3D"md-typeset__table"><tab=
le>
<tbody>
<tr class=3D"odd">
<td><p>System Name:</p></td>
<td><p>Launch</p></td>
</tr>
<!--
<tr class=3D"even">
<td><p>Host Name:</p></td>
<td><p>launch.hprc.tamu.edu</p></td>
</tr>
-->
<tr class=3D"odd">
<td><p>Operating System:</p></td>
<td><p>Red Hat Enterprise 8</p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"even">
<td><p>Total Compute Cores/Nodes:</p></td>
<td><p>8640 cores<br>
45 nodes</p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"odd">
<td><p>Compute Nodes:</p></td>
<td>35 AMD Genoa CPU Nodes with 384 GB<br \=3D"">
10 AMD Genoa GPU nodes each with 2 NVIDIA A30s and 768 GB<br \=3D""></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"even">
<td><p>Interconnect:</p></td>
<td><p>NVIDIA HDR100</p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"odd">
<td><p>Peak Performance:</p></td>
<td><p>436 TFLOPS</p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"even">
<td><p>Global Disk:</p></td>
<td><p>2.2 PB (usable) via Dell storage server</p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"odd">
<td><p>File System:</p></td>
<td><p>NFS</p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"even">
<td><p>Batch Facility:</p></td>
<td><p><a href=3D"http://slurm.schedmd.com/">Slurm by SchedMD</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"odd">
<td><p>Location:</p></td>
<td><p>West Campus Data Center</p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"even">
<td><p>Production Date:</p></td>
<td><p>December 2023</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div></div>

<p>Launch is a Dell Linux cluster with 45 compute nodes (8,640 cores) and 2=
 login nodes.  There are 35 compute nodes with 384 GB memory and 10 GPU com=
pute nodes with 768 GB memory and two NVIDIA A30s.  The interconnecting fab=
ric uses a single NVIDIA HDR100 InfiniBand switch. Shared storage consists =
of 2 PB ZFS based storage accessed via NFS.</p>
<h2 id=3D"compute-nodes">Compute Nodes</h2>
<p>Table 2: Details of Compute Nodes</p>
